sequenceDiagram
    participant Gate
    participant Auth
    participant Audit
    Gate->>Auth: Check the badge
    alt Badge valid
        Auth-->>Gate: Open
        alt After hours
            Gate->>Audit: Log a late entry
        else During the day
            Gate->>Audit: Log an entry
        end
    else Badge expired
        Auth-->>Gate: Deny
    else Badge unknown
        Auth-->>Gate: Deny and alert
        Gate->>Audit: Raise an alarm
    end
